  "title": "Boise Cascade announces 5% quarterly dividend increase",
  "summary": "BOISE, IDAHO — Boise Cascade Company’s (Boise Cascade or the Company) (NYSE: BCC) Board of Directors declared a quarterly dividend of $0.23 per share, an increase of $0.01 per share or 5%, to holders of its common stock. The dividend will be paid on September 16, 2026 to stockholders of record on September 1, 2026. […]",
